		"name": "Discovr Service",
		"description": "Beckn Protocol v2.0 \u2014 Discovr Service API Collection.\n\nCovers catalog discovery (text search, spatial, JSONPath), catalog push (from Catalg CDS), and health endpoints.\n\nGET /beckn/discover is synchronous (returns catalogs directly).\nPOST /beckn/discover is asynchronous (returns ACK, delivers on_discover via callback).\nPOST /catalog/push is fire-and-forget (returns ACK, no callback).\n\nAll POST endpoints are auto-signed via pre-request scripts (requires signing service on sign-host).\nIdentity (subscriberId, recordId) is extracted from the Authorization header.",
