						"description": "Receive a fully-assembled catalog from the Catalg CDS (Catalog Distribution Service).\n\nFire-and-forget: returns 202 ACK, processes asynchronously via Kafka.\nCatalog is persisted to PostgreSQL, indexed in Elasticsearch, and made searchable.\n\npublishDirectives carries updateMode: MERGE (upsert) or FULL (replace all resources for this catalogId).\n\nPayload size limit: 5MB (configurable)."
					},
